    "name":  "Flexible LED Neon 24V - 13W/m - 50m Roll - 6x12mm - Yellow",
    "reference":  "YELLOW92012",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e50m 24V 13W/m Flexible LED Neon Coil is ideal for signage\u003c/strong\u003e and impactful decorations. With 120 SMD 2835 diodes per meter, it offers exceptional brightness that doesn\u0027t fade thanks to its \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-quality silicone construction,\u003c/strong\u003e yellowing resistant. Cut every 1cm and its unique flexibility allows bending it into any shape you need. With IP65 protection, it\u0027s perfect for indoor and outdoor use. Bring your projects to life with this high-performance LED Neon!\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eFlexible LED Neon 24V - 13W/m - 50m Roll - 6x12mm - Yellow\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eFlexible LED Neon 24V\u003c/strong\u003e is a modern efficient option. 50m roll, 6x12mm diameter, 120 SMD2835/m. \u003cstrong\u003eCut every 1cm\u003c/strong\u003e. Flexible.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e13W/m. Weather and water resistant. Apply silicone glue for outdoor use. Encapsulating silicone protects against UV.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRequires 24V power supply.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eApplications: Business outdoor signage, indoor decoration, architectural lighting, advertising.\u003c/h2\u003e",
